{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_chen_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chen_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一鼓作气",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chen_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "abdad9bfea270d60a79e4ad1ff04bc67fb70d5c797ece8e981fd2d1ef0465343",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "那我重复一遍，听好，“我的志愿是加入近卫局，之后，我会加入特别督察组”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我会捍卫这座城市，也会让它变得更干净。那种事不会再发生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我们已经准备好进驻贫民区了，不是吗？我们不是要出台新的感染者居住案吗，这不是变得比昨天更好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们已经准备好去平等善待感染者了，我们善待龙门的每一个人，无论其感染与否，因为他们都是龙门人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "我们准备好了，龙门准备好了吗？大众准备好了吗？商业联合会会投票吗？现在我告诉近卫局我是感染者，你猜会发生什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九，你是不是从一开始就知道，我做的事不会成功？\n那么，你为什么要帮助我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......陈......陈警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "真难得啊，向来对工作一丝不苟的陈警司也会在这种地方偷懒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "诗怀雅，你现在应该在贫民区外围待命才对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "那边准备得差不多了，我是来喊你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "对讲机的信号范围能覆盖到贫民区。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "但是我想亲眼看看你哭丧着脸的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你指什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "别装了，陈晖洁，九是你的后盾，新的感染者居住案是你今年最上心的事之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "而现在，九突然辞职，法案没有通过，你说我想看什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "九不是我的后盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "魏总督也不是，嗯哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "一个“毫无背景”加入近卫局两年不到的新人，不仅刷新了加入特别督察组的最快记录，还成为了新的感染者居住案的有力推动者之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "看来在入组测验上输给我这件事，比我想象的还让你记恨，施怀雅家的大小姐，心眼也不过如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "嘁，技不如人，这我认了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "不过，我第一次在近卫局以外的地方听到你的名字竟然是在一场宴会上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "陈晖洁小姐，你知道为什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "因为那份法案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "他们说，你自以为有魏总督和九做后盾，就觉得自己好像能做到什么事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "然后他们碰了碰杯，一脸自得地说了句“自不量力”，接着聊别的去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......自不量力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "对，你为这件事的不停奔走在他们眼里就是这种程度的东西，他们甚至没有再提到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "而如果你现在还打算在这里偷懒，那我可以告诉你，你另一件准备许久的事——近卫局入驻贫民区，也做不成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "几支队伍都准备好了，九现在不在，你是主导者，所有人都在等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我还不用你来教我做事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "你最好不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "Missy，为什么你不把你当时走上去把手里的酒浇在那两个人头上的事也一起说了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我又不是来安慰她，或者和她同仇敌忾的，我是来嘲笑她的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "而且她是今天行动的负责人，她不动起来，难道要我去指挥吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但你至少觉得她没做错，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我从小呢，也见过不少在我祖父面前，摆出一副自己想要做大事的样子的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "不过他们大多只是装的，想骗点钱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那位想必慧眼如炬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "他老人家是不是慧眼如炬我不知道，但托他的福，我可擅长分辨那种只知道装腔作势的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那老陈呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "正蠢材。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，无法反驳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "走吧，今天要做的事可有不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "陈警司，今天是近卫局驻贫民区办事处成立的大好日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "可以说一下您现在的心情吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "无可奉告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员A",
      "text": "走开走开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "记者",
      "text": "哎，你怎么推人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员A",
      "text": "哎，不知道哪里钻出来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我不是说了，不允许记者靠近吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员A",
      "text": "陈警司，我们赶了。进驻贫民区这么大阵仗的事，哪里赶得走这些苍蝇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员B",
      "text": "都在等着我们出丑呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员B",
      "text": "呃，没有说您这个决策有问题，只是，九忽然辞职，您又是感染者居住案的推动者之一，这会儿难免有些风口浪尖的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......让他们拍吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "列队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员们",
      "text": "到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "一直以来，贫民区对于近卫局来说，都是块难啃的骨头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "贫民区藏污纳垢，贫民区有感染者，贫民区是法外之地......贫民区是龙门的一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我知道你们之中有许多人对于进驻贫民区也不理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员们",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但我要说，之所以形成这种状况，我们这些生活在市区的人需要承担起一部分责任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "是我们没有将贫民区当作龙门的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "而今天，以及未来，我们要做的，就是用我们的行动去告诉这里的人，他们也是龙门的一分子，龙门对他们一视同仁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "明白了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员们",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "别的不说，我们对贫民区的人有没有一视同仁我是不知道，有些人对我们还是挺一视同仁的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不管我们近卫局在哪里做什么，都会想来给我们搞点麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "而今天呢，是咱们在贫民区“开张大吉”的日子，肯定会有些看不惯我们的人来送礼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "大家伙也不用想太多，我们兵来将挡水来土掩就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "完事了之后，今晚我请客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员A",
      "text": "吃啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "大排档。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员们",
      "text": "切......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你们要是能说动老陈也掏腰包，那就是另一回事了，对吧，老陈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员B",
      "text": "陈警司，怎么说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，这就对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陈警司，阿发在我们手上，不想他死的话，就麻烦你一个人走一趟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不愧是陈警司，痛快人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "发给你了，半个小时内你如果没有出现，阿发的命就难保了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陈，怎么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "麻烦这就来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我跟你一起去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不用，我一个人应付得来，指挥权暂时交给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "各位，准备开始扫除了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警员们",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我来了，一个人，没别人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "陈警司......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "阿发，你只有一个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "对唔住，陈警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......你骗我，阿发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "铁锚帮的老大逼我在这里把你炸死，我不做，我的老母就得死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贫民区居民",
      "text": "他们知道你是对这件事最上心的人，只要把你解决，这件事就成不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
